Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.91,0:00:05.51,Main,Principal,0,0,0,,We're fortunate to have clear skies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.98,0:00:07.86,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\b1\shad0\c&H595D58&\3c&HF7FAF8&}Katagiri High School Sports Day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.51,0:00:08.67,Main,Principal,0,0,0,,and perfect weather for sports day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.10,0:00:14.35,Main,Principal,0,0,0,,Please practice good sportsmanship \Nand enjoy this day to the fullest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:18.05,Main,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.87,0:00:21.10,Main,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,And now, the pledge of fair play.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:30.88,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an5\fnComic Sans MS\fs48\fax.5\shad0\bord3\frz331.3\b1\c&H211E22&\3c&HEFF2E7&\pos(517,151)}Gloom
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:34.38,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,We, the students of Katagiri High School,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:37.42,Main - Top,Male Student A,0,0,0,,The class president's looking a little blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.97,0:00:38.68,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,{bg}will now demonstrate the results \Nof all our training.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.42,0:00:39.32,Main - Top,Male Student B,0,0,0,,Despite his red hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.32,0:00:41.39,Main - Top,Male Student C,0,0,0,,It's quite a contrast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.39,0:00:44.39,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}The president actually came to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.64,0:00:48.40,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Good thing it's so cool today, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:50.51,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Lots of people are in long sleeves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.19,0:00:52.90,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.63,0:00:58.01,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Sengoku was saying, "Miyamura-kun's \Nactually going to try?! That traitor!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.01,0:00:58.78,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.45,0:01:05.86,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I never had a reason to try hard before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.23,0:01:08.61,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Honestly, the whole thing bored me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.42,0:01:13.99,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,But this year, I've got to beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.42,0:01:17.93,Main,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,And now, Katagiri High School sports day...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.93,0:01:19.12,Main,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,has officially begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.18,0:01:21.97,Main,_Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(1270,1)\fnArial\an8\b1\bord0\fs16\shad1\c&H5AE1E8&\3c&H514946&\4c&H3E7E70&\pos(470.545,131.091)}Sports Day
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.02,0:02:56.03,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\b1\fay-.1\fs18\shad0\c&H595D58&\3c&HF7FAF8&\pos(291,169)}Katagiri High School Sports Day
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.85,0:02:56.03,Main - Italics,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,With that, the east and west teams\Nare looking evenly matched!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.03,0:02:59.78,Main - Italics,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,I'll bet the second-year girls'\Nhurdle race had everyone sweating!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.23,0:03:01.94,Main,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree, Nakamine-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.94,0:03:03.29,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,It was incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.29,0:03:04.33,Main,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,There you have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.33,0:03:06.54,Main,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,Well done, second-years!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.54,0:03:15.67,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,520)\an8\fnArial\b1\shad0\c&H1D1F1E&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(133.819,104.786)}West
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.54,0:03:15.67,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,520)\fnArial\b1\fs20\shad0\c&H1D1F1E&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(323,289)}Miyamura • Ishikawa • Kawano • Ayasaki • Yanagi
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.09,0:03:10.29,Main - Top,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Do the third-years run the hurdles next?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.29,0:03:11.17,Main - Top,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.55,0:03:12.78,Main - Top,Remi,0,0,0,,Let's go, Sakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.74,0:03:15.59,Main - Top,Sakura,0,0,0,,Just make sure not to get hurt, Remi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.59,0:03:17.09,Main - Top,Remi,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.67,0:03:22.03,Main - Top,Iura,0,0,0,,Sengoku-san, let's do \Nthe three-legged race together!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.67,0:03:27.93,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\b1\shad0\c&H1D1F1E&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(506.819,108.786)}East
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.67,0:03:27.93,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fs20\shad0\c&H1D1F1E&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(323,289)}Hori • Sengoku • Iura • Yoshikawa
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.03,0:03:24.36,Main - Top,Iura,0,0,0,,I don't have a partner yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.36,0:03:27.93,Main - Top,Hori,0,0,0,,Sengoku, do topple-the-pole. \NThey need another boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.93,0:03:29.90,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I'd rather be a shellfish...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.90,0:03:32.57,Main,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,{\i1}Next up is the third-year \Ngirls' hurdle race.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.41,0:03:36.06,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Well, I'll see you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.06,0:03:37.94,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Good luck, Hori!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:49.33,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs12\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\c&H414A3C&\3c&HF0EFF1&\pos(15,198)}Flying high to the east sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.40,0:03:44.80,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,I guess we're in the same race.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.80,0:03:47.38,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,I bet you're really fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.38,0:03:49.32,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.32,0:03:52.64,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah, right. Like I believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.75,0:03:54.08,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1270,1)\an8\fs14\blur1\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\c&H414A3C&\3c&HD4AEC4&\pos(472,226)\frz10.86}I shall mow down any who stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.37,0:03:54.08,Main - Top,Hori,0,0,0,,I shall mow down any who stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.08,0:03:55.62,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.62,0:03:56.59,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.59,0:03:57.92,Main - Top,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.59,0:03:58.34,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Do it, west team!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.34,0:04:02.32,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Hori-san, Miyamura-kun is cheering for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.67,0:04:05.67,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I think he's cheering for\Nall of Team West, Ayasaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.67,0:04:07.10,Main,Female Official,0,0,0,,Next heat, line up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.61,0:04:12.39,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,I'll work hard to impress Miyamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.39,0:04:14.87,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I really don't think he \Nmeant you in particular...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.40,0:04:14.87,Main - Top,Female Official,0,0,0,,On your marks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.87,0:04:18.11,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,If I win, then Miyamura-kun belongs to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.11,0:04:19.36,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Kyon-Kyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.89,0:04:21.07,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Kyon... Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.07,0:04:22.31,Main,Female Official,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.86,0:04:24.74,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.24,0:04:26.77,Main,Male Student A,0,0,0,,Ayasaki's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.77,0:04:27.85,Main,Male Student B,0,0,0,,Is she the dark horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.85,0:04:30.24,Main - Italics,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,West's Ayasaki-san is leading heat 5!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.23,0:04:37.45,Main - Top + Italics,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, that's gonna hurt! \NAnd it'll cost her time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.96,0:04:36.70,Main,Male Student A,0,0,0,,That sounded painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.70,0:04:38.23,Main,Male Student B,0,0,0,,I think she kicked it on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.23,0:04:39.63,Main,Male Student A,0,0,0,,Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.14,0:04:44.48,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,Ayasaki-san had to go mess with my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.48,0:04:45.63,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.63,0:04:48.24,Main - Italics,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,Team East seems to be trailing behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.59,0:04:50.18,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know that, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.93,0:04:54.05,Main,Male Student C,0,0,0,,That last girl on the east team \Nis looking really intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.05,0:04:56.50,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's in our class.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.52,0:04:57.02,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs16\fnComic Sans MS\b1\bord3\shad0\c&H313033&\3c&HE2EBEB&\pos(31,292)}Her boyfriend
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.77,0:05:00.77,Main - Italics,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,East takes first! And west takes second!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.85,0:05:04.90,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,{\i1}And after I told Miyamura not to slack...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.87,0:05:08.14,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,{\i1}I suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.98,0:05:18.86,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Hori-san, don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.43,0:05:30.38,Main,Male Student D,0,0,0,,You're not supposed \Nto cheer for the other team!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.38,0:05:32.93,Main,Male Student E,0,0,0,,Finish strong, Team East!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.93,0:05:34.65,Main,Male Student E,0,0,0,,Damn, she's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.65,0:05:36.94,Main - Italics,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,East has suddenly picked up speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.00,0:05:41.11,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Kyon-Kyon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.32,0:05:44.32,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Enough with the "Kyon-Kyon" stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.57,0:05:47.96,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,You and Miyamura-kun are so in love,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.96,0:05:51.14,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,I couldn't bear to steal him from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.14,0:05:52.33,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,{\i1}This little...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.45,0:05:56.89,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Just kidding! I've already got Sengoku-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.89,0:05:59.89,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,It's so cute that you get flustered so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.89,0:06:01.78,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.78,0:06:03.71,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,H-Hori-san, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.71,0:06:12.47,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\fay-.07\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\c&H7C807A&\3c&HF0EFF1&\pos(452,155)}Katagiri High School ~ Sports Day
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.41,0:06:06.13,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Sorry, were you discussing something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.13,0:06:08.61,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,We're done, so I'll be on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.61,0:06:10.63,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,I'll even take this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.63,0:06:12.47,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Ah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.86,0:06:14.55,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,How's your leg?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.05,0:06:16.53,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,That was quite a hurdle race.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.53,0:06:18.06,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I came in last.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.06,0:06:21.00,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,You looked so good in practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:23.21,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,How come you stalled out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.11,0:06:26.11,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.11,0:06:31.87,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fnArial\fay-.1\shad0\fs18\c&H76766F&\3c&HF6FBF3&\move(294,68,302.727,68)}Scoreboard
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.11,0:06:31.87,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fnArial\fay-.05\shad0\fs18\c&H76766F&\3c&HF6FBF3&\move(198.727,137.818,206.727,137.818)}East
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.11,0:06:31.87,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fnArial\fay-.05\shad0\fs18\c&H76766F&\3c&HF6FBF3&\move(391.454,122.546,400.182,122.546)}West
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.56,0:06:28.99,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,S-So why'd you speed up at the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.99,0:06:30.66,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,That was because of you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.87,0:06:33.05,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.05,0:06:35.10,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,The next heat is starting, \Nso I'm going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.10,0:06:36.66,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You should, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.66,0:06:38.09,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.09,0:06:39.25,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,And one more thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.97,0:06:42.01,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Thanks for cheering for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.54,0:06:44.78,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,It made me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.37,0:06:47.37,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.92,0:06:53.76,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Check it out, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.01,0:06:58.60,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Sawada-san's on our team.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.60,0:07:01.37,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Can she even pull the tug-of-war rope?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.77,0:07:05.40,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord0\fs18\c&H1E2F34&\b1\frz323.8\move(312.001,119.637,325.091,134.91,0,2613)}Swish\N\h\h\h\hSwish
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.77,0:07:05.40,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Hori-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.77,0:07:05.40,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs16\fnArial\b1\shad0\c&H2A2A2F&\3c&HE9F0EE&\move(111.183,10.604,134.456,30.967,0,2613)}Hori going back\Nto her team's tent
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.40,0:07:07.38,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Watch me compete!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.38,0:07:09.35,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Sawada-san's on the other team, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.35,0:07:10.31,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.65,0:07:12.06,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,You can do it, Sawada!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.06,0:07:13.71,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Go for it, Sawada-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.41,0:07:14.66,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord0\c&H1E2F34&\b1\frz8.771\pos(285.818,67.818)}Snub
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.66,0:07:15.66,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:18.66,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord3\c&H322D2D&\b1\frz8.771\pos(195.636,132.545)\3c&HF6F6F6&}Glance
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.91,0:07:19.62,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(230,60)\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord3\c&H322D2D&\b1\frz8.771\3c&HF6F6F6&\pos(80.727,109.272)}Grin
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.81,0:07:25.84,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I thought maybe I was cheering too loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.84,0:07:28.55,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Everyone loves having \Nsomeone root for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.42,0:07:31.18,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Even you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.91,0:07:37.68,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I don't think I've ever really cheered for\Nanyone or vice versa at sports day before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.68,0:07:41.61,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,At least cheer more for your team\Nthan our opponents, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.61,0:07:44.14,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,It was just the heat of the moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.14,0:07:45.19,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.49,0:07:49.82,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Make sure you cheer for me\N on the obstacle course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.51,0:07:53.75,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Drown out the other team, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.07,0:07:56.58,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs36\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\c&H3A30AC&\3c&H4C97CA&\pos(453.546,81.637)}West, Fighting Fierce!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.49,0:07:55.27,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.58,0:07:58.33,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord3\c&H322D2D&\b1\an8\3c&HF0E1E1&}Disappointed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.86,0:08:01.84,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Hori-senpai, we lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:06.59,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,D-Don't let it get you down. We had\Na lot of athletes on the east team side.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.59,0:08:10.75,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I wanted you to see me win!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.75,0:08:12.76,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,This is the east team area, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.17,0:08:17.87,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Ishikawa-kun's up next!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.87,0:08:19.11,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Let's give a great cheer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.11,0:08:20.76,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.60,0:08:24.95,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Iura, you'd better win!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.77,0:08:26.90,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fs36\shad0\bord3\c&H322D2D&\b1\an8\3c&HF2F5F8&}INTENSE
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.95,0:08:26.91,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Get first! You hear? First!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.90,0:08:32.03,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord3\c&H322D2D&\b1\an8\3c&HEEEBEB&\frz348.1\move(373.818,30.364,382.546,15.091,0,5111)}Peaceful
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.91,0:08:29.03,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Good luck, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.03,0:08:32.03,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Ishikawa— Y-You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.03,0:08:41.04,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an4\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\c&H414A3C&\3c&HF0EFF1&}West\N{\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord3\c&H322D2D&\b1\3c&HECFCF9&}Pleasant
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.03,0:08:41.04,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an6\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\c&H414A3C&\3c&HF0EFF1&}East\N{\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord3\c&H322D2D&\b1\3c&HECFCF9&}THUNDEROUS
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.42,0:08:34.85,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,I wish I were on Team West.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.85,0:08:36.80,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,If I lose, my team might kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.80,0:08:37.73,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Where's Sengoku?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.73,0:08:41.04,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,He said he's only doing\Nthe events that everyone has to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.44,0:08:42.54,Main,Female Official,0,0,0,,On your marks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.98,0:08:46.04,Main,Female Official,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.15,0:08:50.09,Main - Italics,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,The boys' obstacle course is underway!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.09,0:08:51.92,Main - Italics,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,First up is the balance beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.92,0:08:54.97,Main - Italics,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,East and west are neck and neck! \NNeither is giving up the lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.97,0:08:55.60,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,I—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.60,0:08:57.42,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Ishikawa-kun, keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.74,0:08:58.41,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Ishi—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.41,0:09:01.35,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Ishikawa-kun, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.97,0:09:03.73,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,All together...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.73,0:09:06.23,Main,_All,0,0,0,,Go for it, Ishikawa-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.23,0:09:08.73,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Again! Ready, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.73,0:09:11.86,Main,_All,0,0,0,,Go, Ishikawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:14.86,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Must be nice to have\Nthe girls cheering for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.40,0:09:14.86,Main - Top,_All,0,0,0,,{bg}Go, Ishikawa-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.86,0:09:18.37,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Except there's one\Nhigh-pitched guy in there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.69,0:09:20.87,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,{\i1}So you're finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.02,0:09:23.58,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,{\i1}able to speak up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.62,0:09:27.30,Main - Italics,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,Which team will prevail?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.30,0:09:29.50,Main,_All,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.46,0:09:32.09,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,So you tied?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.09,0:09:37.96,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,"Well, that must mean that Iura really\Nwent for it," or so Yoshikawa-san said.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.96,0:09:39.43,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,You have my praise as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.34,0:09:40.60,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord2\fs16\c&H322D2D&\b1\3c&HECFCF9&\pos(214.546,145.455)}Sparkle
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.43,0:09:40.60,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.09,0:09:42.69,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Where are the girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.69,0:09:46.10,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Getting ready for the cheer \Ncompetition coming up next.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.39,0:09:49.98,Main - Italics,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,Now for the event the boys have been \Nwaiting for, the cheer competition!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.98,0:09:52.48,Main - Italics,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,First up are the east third-year girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.78,0:09:55.49,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Come on, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.83,0:09:56.74,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Say!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.74,0:09:57.49,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,E!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.49,0:09:58.24,Main,_All,0,0,0,,A!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.24,0:09:59.01,Main,_All,0,0,0,,S!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.01,0:09:59.74,Main,_All,0,0,0,,T!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.74,0:10:02.74,Main,_All,0,0,0,,The great-east team!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.74,0:10:04.89,Main,Female Student A,0,0,0,,I just love Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.74,0:10:10.75,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord3\an8\c&H4F554B&\b1\3c&HF4FBE7&\pos(274.91,225.273)}Disappointed
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.89,0:10:06.52,Main,Female Student B,0,0,0,,She's the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.52,0:10:08.37,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,I've never seen a cheer like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.37,0:10:10.75,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Neither have I.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.07,0:10:14.76,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,How does her boyfriend feel about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.76,0:10:16.82,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's glazed over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.82,0:10:18.13,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Figured as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.13,0:10:20.04,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Fear not, Team West!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.37,0:10:22.14,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Ready? Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.14,0:10:23.64,Main,_All,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.64,0:10:25.14,Main,_All,0,0,0,,Go, go, west!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.14,0:10:26.64,Main,_All,0,0,0,,Win, win, west!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.64,0:10:28.42,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,We've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.42,0:10:30.65,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Let's go, Team West!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.78,0:10:35.74,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,East won over the girls, \Nand west won over the guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.74,0:10:37.64,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Do you think Remi was a little too cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.64,0:10:39.40,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Are you listening, Sengoku-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.40,0:10:42.41,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right, right, left, and up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.41,0:10:44.41,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now punch up and to the left!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.41,0:10:47.66,Main,_All,0,0,0,,The strong-west team!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.86,0:10:52.14,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.55,0:10:57.61,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Good work on the third-year cheer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.61,0:10:59.31,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Man, that was hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.31,0:11:00.35,Main,East Girl 1,0,0,0,,Good work!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.35,0:11:01.87,Main,East Girl 2,0,0,0,,Hori-san, you did great!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.87,0:11:02.80,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.80,0:11:03.96,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Yoshikawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:06.59,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Nice job, Kono-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.59,0:11:08.90,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,The west team looked great!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.90,0:11:10.70,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Y-You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.26,0:11:12.44,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.27,0:11:15.50,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,For helping me practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.92,0:11:18.69,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,I didn't get to properly thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.69,0:11:21.20,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,I-It's a bit late now, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.07,0:11:24.07,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,You're so serious, Kono-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.07,0:11:25.83,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Not really...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.72,0:11:30.68,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe Ishikawa-kun noticed me a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.33,0:11:33.08,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs36\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\c&H282924&\3c&HF5F7F0&\an8}West
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.08,0:11:35.09,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord3\an8\c&H322D2D&\b1\3c&HF4F2ED&\pos(314.91,207.819)\frz354.3}Sadness...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.40,0:11:37.87,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You knew what was coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.87,0:11:41.60,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I just really wanted to see her \Nin a cheerleading outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.84,0:11:42.84,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnArial\b1\fs16\shad0\c&H2A2A2F&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(45.001,178.604)}Disappointment
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.15,0:11:45.60,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,Miyamura-kun, can I borrow you for a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:52.60,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\c&H3A30AC&\3c&H4C97CA&\pos(511.728,70)}West, fighting fierce!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.18,0:11:49.08,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Do you need me for something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.08,0:11:52.60,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,Yes, one of the boys is out with a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.60,0:11:54.73,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,Could you please take his place?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.22,0:11:58.89,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,You aren't in any individual events, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.89,0:12:01.11,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,No, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.73,0:12:04.26,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,A-Are you sure you want me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.91,0:12:07.99,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,I'm asking you, so of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.32,0:12:12.04,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Oh, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.04,0:12:13.49,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.49,0:12:14.62,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.62,0:12:16.00,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,You'll do great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.95,0:12:21.74,Flashback - Italics,High School Boy 1,0,0,0,,{fb}Miyamura came in third.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.74,0:12:23.51,Flashback - Italics,High School Girl 1,0,0,0,,{fb}What a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.37,0:12:28.80,Flashback - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{fb+int}Someone more athletic should \Nhave entered all the events.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.57,0:12:31.77,Flashback - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,{fb}It made me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.77,0:12:33.32,Flashback - Italics,Terajima,0,0,0,,You'll do great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.64,0:12:36.77,Flashback - Italics,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Everyone loves having \Nsomeone root for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.69,0:12:44.94,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sports day is actually kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.94,0:12:46.03,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fad(1009,1)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\c&H414A3C&\3c&HF0EFF1&\pos(266.636,104.909)}Flying high to the east sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.03,0:12:51.14,Main,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,Next is the scavenger hunt, \Nour only coed event!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.14,0:12:55.35,Main - Top + Italics,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,Open an envelope, find what's written \Ninside, and bring it to the finish line!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.36,0:12:55.35,Main,Male Student A,0,0,0,,Glasses! Anyone wearing glasses?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.35,0:12:56.79,Main,Male Student B,0,0,0,,Any girls with ponytails?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.79,0:12:59.36,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,I'll be the first to the finish line!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.36,0:13:03.80,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,That's great. I can help you get\Nto the finish line in life, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:04.69,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:05.30,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\b1\shad0\c&H575959&\3c&HE9F0EE&\frz16.11\pos(244.274,57.15)}Someone suspicious
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.30,0:13:09.02,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Say, Yoshikawa,\Nwhat were you supposed to find?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.72,0:13:11.73,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Th-The youngest teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.73,0:13:12.81,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.81,0:13:14.40,Main - Italics,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,East has reached the finish line!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.40,0:13:16.47,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yuki finished first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.79,0:13:18.32,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.84,0:13:21.57,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll finish first, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.07,0:13:25.18,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.18,0:13:26.73,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I'll get a different one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.73,0:13:28.04,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,No, you can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.04,0:13:29.70,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Huh? Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.95,0:13:31.96,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Miyamura?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.96,0:13:33.34,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.34,0:13:36.58,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Well, someone was absent, \Nso I got asked to fill in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.58,0:13:38.58,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Hori, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.58,0:13:40.57,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Crap, I'm falling behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.94,0:13:42.94,Main,_Both,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.59,0:13:46.22,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord3\an8\c&H322D2D&\b1\3c&HF4F2ED&\pos(227.637,192.546)\frz7.844}Flustered
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.22,0:13:49.50,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Jeez, what is Miyamura-kun doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.50,0:13:52.27,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Both he and Hori-san seem surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.27,0:13:53.83,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Book it, Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:55.73,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Keep it up, Kyo-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.95,0:14:00.23,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,What're you doing over here, Sengoku?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.23,0:14:02.13,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,It was a close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.23,0:14:05.74,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fs15\shad0\bord3\c&H322D2D&\b1\3c&HF4F2ED&\frz8.534\pos(277.819,114)}East team
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.13,0:14:05.74,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,They were looking for a sub \Nand would have entered me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.74,0:14:06.79,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,but I slipped away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.79,0:14:08.61,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Y-You seem invigorated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.99,0:14:12.54,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Hey... Wait! What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.54,0:14:16.25,Main - Italics,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,C-Could it be that east and \Nwest drew the same thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.25,0:14:17.37,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,How does that happen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.37,0:14:19.99,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I need him, Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.99,0:14:21.50,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I do, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.50,0:14:23.37,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Hold on! You're gonna pop out my shoulders!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.37,0:14:24.75,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,H-Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.75,0:14:26.43,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Sengoku-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.43,0:14:28.38,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,You don't need to cheer for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.38,0:14:31.39,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.39,0:14:34.39,Main,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,The final two participants \Nhave crossed the finish line...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.39,0:14:36.06,Main,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,at the same time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:39.52,Main - Italics,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,The both seem to have brought \Nthe student council president.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.52,0:14:41.72,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Why'd you have to pick me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.29,0:14:47.03,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,What did you have on your slips?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.03,0:14:49.03,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,520)\an8\fnArial\b1\fs18\shad0\c&H4F5151&\3c&HE9F0EE&\frz334.7\pos(165.001,103.695)}A skinny boy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.03,0:14:49.03,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,520)\an8\fnArial\b1\fs18\shad0\c&H4F5151&\3c&HE9F0EE&\frz15\pos(480.638,100.059)}Student council president
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.65,0:14:53.00,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I understand Kyo-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.00,0:14:55.87,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,But you, Miyamura-kun!\NThere are plenty of other skinny guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.87,0:14:59.02,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I thought I should find the skinniest one...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.02,0:15:01.79,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,You traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.79,0:15:06.30,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fnArial\fay-.1\shad0\fs18\c&H76766F&\3c&HF6FBF3&)\pos(293.091,27.091)}Scoreboard
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.79,0:15:06.30,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fnArial\fay-.05\shad0\fs18\c&H696362&\3c&HF6FBF3&\pos(167.273,119.455)}East
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.79,0:15:06.30,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fnArial\fay-.05\shad0\fs18\c&H696362&\3c&HF6FBF3&\pos(430.545,101.273)}West
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.73,0:15:06.30,Main - Italics,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,The third-year boys' mock cavalry \Nbattle is starting soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.30,0:15:10.05,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fnArial\shad0\fs12\c&H312D22&\3c&HC8C7AD&\frz6.227\pos(368.726,251.091)\frx356\fry16}Announcer
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.80,0:15:10.05,Main - Italics,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,All competitors, please get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.05,0:15:12.05,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,You'll be the rider, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.05,0:15:14.05,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You'll be the rider, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.06,0:15:18.75,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Is it my weight again?\NWhy is it always about that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.75,0:15:20.93,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You'd snap in half \Nif you were on the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.93,0:15:23.33,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,We're not branches.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.33,0:15:26.00,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,If we're doing this,\NSengoku-san, let's win it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:26.82,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.82,0:15:28.32,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnArial\b1\fs16\shad0\c&H2A2A2F&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(42.092,203.331)}Visibly\Ndifferent\Ntemperatures
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.32,0:15:29.25,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Yay, yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.25,0:15:30.20,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Yay, yay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.20,0:15:31.05,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Yay, yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.05,0:15:31.95,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Yay, yay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.95,0:15:33.94,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Gimme a "Yeah!", Sengoku-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.94,0:15:36.34,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Okay, we're going for Sengoku first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.82,0:15:36.33,Main - Top,Iura,0,0,0,,{bg}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.33,0:15:37.37,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.75,0:15:37.83,Main - Top,Iura,0,0,0,,{bg}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.58,0:15:41.79,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Yanagi-kun's on top, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.09,0:15:41.45,Main - Top,Teammate_Yanagi,0,0,0,,{bg}Hey, looking good!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.45,0:15:42.63,Main - Top,Yanagi,0,0,0,,{bg}Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.79,0:15:44.83,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,{\i1}All the riders are the least \Ncompetitive people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.83,0:15:47.09,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Upsy-daisy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.84,0:15:54.22,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I'm actually starting to enjoy this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.22,0:15:55.03,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.03,0:15:55.72,Main,Teammate_Sengoku,0,0,0,,Finally?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.72,0:15:58.59,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,The view from up here is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.59,0:16:02.23,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Sengoku-san is fancying \Nhimself a general of sorts!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.55,0:16:05.34,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Sengoku looks like he's raring to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.73,0:16:07.61,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Time to get to it, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.61,0:16:08.48,Main,_Both,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.48,0:16:11.68,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Sengoku! You'd better score a point!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.68,0:16:12.86,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.86,0:16:15.16,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Hori's cheering for Sengoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.16,0:16:17.87,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Of course. She's on his team.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.87,0:16:20.37,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,But doesn't that tick you off?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.87,0:16:23.80,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,So, what's our strategy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.20,0:16:26.50,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Sengoku's a clever one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.73,0:16:29.58,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Then how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.51,0:16:36.64,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Are we supposed to cheer for the rider?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.64,0:16:42.02,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,They're all working hard, but the guy \Non top has the most important role.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.64,0:16:45.27,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,520)\an8\fnArial\b1\fs16\shad0\c&H3C3C57&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(337.455,80.545)}Detail-oriented
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.02,0:16:44.90,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,I see. The mock cavalry battle \Nis pretty complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.58,0:16:47.27,Main,_Both,0,0,0,,Miyamura-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.27,0:16:49.24,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Good luck, Miyamura-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.24,0:16:50.53,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Do your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.91,0:16:53.52,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why are they only calling Miyamura's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.52,0:16:56.92,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Sengoku-san, Ayasaki-san \Nis cheering for Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.92,0:16:58.03,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Doesn't that tick you off?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.03,0:17:00.71,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,We're on different teams, \Nso of course she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.71,0:17:02.79,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,What are you getting at, Iura-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.79,0:17:03.86,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.79,0:17:04.29,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnArial\b1\fs16\shad0\c&H2A2A2F&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(53.728,188.786)}Visibly\Ndifferent\Ntemperatures
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.71,0:17:07.29,Main - Italics,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,Okay, teams, to your starting positions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.29,0:17:10.84,Main - Italics,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,Who will stand in the winner's circle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:12.75,Main - Italics,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.88,0:17:15.98,Main,Background Student,0,0,0,,Get on both sides of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.47,0:17:15.98,Main - Top,Background Student,0,0,0,,Go around back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.31,0:17:22.23,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.23,0:17:23.39,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Maybe over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.72,0:17:27.31,Main,Teammate_East,0,0,0,,This Team West guy is\Ngrabbing at random! Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.31,0:17:29.94,Main - Top,Teammate_Yanagi,0,0,0,,Hey, Yanagi, open your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.94,0:17:32.64,Main - Top,Yanagi,0,0,0,,It won't help. I forgot my glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.62,0:17:34.32,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Yanagi's doing better than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.79,0:17:37.89,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,President...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.38,0:17:42.58,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I'm taking you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.96,0:17:49.70,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,The west team can dodge like the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.70,0:17:52.46,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure anyone could've dodged that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.46,0:17:54.59,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Miyamura, get ready to strike back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.59,0:17:55.72,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.71,0:18:02.05,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Why's Sengoku so fired up all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.05,0:18:04.53,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,He seems to have awoken his inner general.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.53,0:18:06.85,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Huh. That makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.85,0:18:10.80,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Look alive, Sengoku!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.80,0:18:12.11,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.11,0:18:13.65,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Grab him by the head!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.65,0:18:15.24,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(190,1)\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord0\c&H18374F&\b1\frz8.771\3c&HF6F6F6&\pos(41.454,164.545)}Stare
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.65,0:18:15.24,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Do you want Miyamura dead?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.29,0:18:19.07,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}The president is good at evading.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.55,0:18:20.49,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.87,0:18:22.40,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Can you take it in one fell swoop?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.40,0:18:24.24,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,I'm just about at my limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.59,0:18:25.83,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Ishikawa-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.83,0:18:29.00,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see. It's a lot more tiring \Nto play the horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:30.45,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Ishikawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.45,0:18:32.46,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,The top of my nose really itches.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.46,0:18:34.25,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Really? Mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.96,0:18:37.12,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is becoming a war of attrition.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.21,0:18:39.27,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.09,0:18:46.60,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.13,0:18:51.31,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,President.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.45,0:18:53.87,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Who is that girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.06,0:18:59.04,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,that's been sitting...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.07,0:19:03.41,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,on your shoulder?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.77,0:19:12.67,Main - Italics,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,The...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.14,0:19:17.67,Main - Italics,Female Student Announcer,0,0,0,,The west team has prevailed over east!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.30,0:19:22.22,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Sengoku totally just\Nturned his back, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.53,0:19:23.68,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.22,0:19:26.29,Main,Teammate_Male,0,0,0,,Nice job, Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.29,0:19:27.06,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Aw, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.44,0:19:29.63,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,No big deal, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.63,0:19:34.22,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,What? It's a huge deal, Hori!\NLook at the score!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.19,0:19:41.20,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fnArial\shad0\fs18\c&H2D5D7F&\3c&HF5FBF8&\pos(168.727,100.546)}East
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.19,0:19:41.20,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fnArial\shad0\fs18\c&H619BC7&\3c&HF5FBF8&\pos(532.363,99.819)}West
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.63,0:19:44.82,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Come on, Remi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.21,0:19:46.68,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,We need to put these chairs back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.68,0:19:49.44,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,We were ahead until the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.11,0:19:52.66,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,It's nice that Sengoku-kun \Nwon though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.41,0:19:59.09,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,But you practiced so hard for the cheer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.01,0:20:05.72,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Not that hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.32,0:20:10.94,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,You were the cutest one out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.94,0:20:12.33,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Sure, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.36,0:20:19.11,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}My nose got sunburned and it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.86,0:20:24.57,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shindo's gonna make fun of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.44,0:20:29.37,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Huh? Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.64,0:20:31.37,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.58,0:20:35.94,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Why are you in such a hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.86,0:20:39.28,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Wh-Why are you in a cheerleading outfit?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.28,0:20:40.83,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Sports day is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.83,0:20:42.29,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Oh, this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.29,0:20:45.01,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,The girls are taking a group picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.46,0:20:47.62,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I wore the boy's uniform \Nfor the competition,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.62,0:20:51.02,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,so I figured I could at least \Nwear this for the group photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.02,0:20:53.44,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,You looked really good in that uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.44,0:20:54.52,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.86,0:20:58.31,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I guess I'm the reason we won, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.31,0:21:00.57,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm so glad I got sunburned.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.98,0:21:06.55,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}The person who's been rooting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.94,0:21:08.82,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}since before sports day,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.35,0:21:12.83,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}even long before that,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.77,0:21:11.01,Main - Top,Hori,0,0,0,,Is your face red?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.01,0:21:12.00,Main - Top,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I got sunburned.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.21,0:21:16.83,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}is shining brighter than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.21,0:21:18.58,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Am I cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.58,0:21:21.44,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Kidding! Just imitating Ayasaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.96,0:21:23.11,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,You are cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.05,0:21:25.64,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Super cute, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.12,0:21:34.35,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.35,0:21:36.85,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You big dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.00,0:21:43.99,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Today might've been
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.99,0:21:45.32,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.32,0:21:50.24,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}my first and last sports day...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.41,0:21:59.29,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,It was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.28,0:22:07.85,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's how I felt after it was all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.56,0:23:40.06,Main,Next Ep,0,0,0,,{\fad(487,1)\c&HC2A774&\3c&HF4F9ED&\shad0\an7\fs16\pos(452.242,317.744)}Next time\Npage.4 Hori Kotatsu
